  "question": {
    "prompt": "In \\(\\triangle ABC\\), \\(D\\) and \\(E\\) lie on \\(AB\\) and \\(AC\\), respectively, and \\(DE\\parallel BC\\). Given \\(AD=4\\), \\(DB=2\\), and \\(EC=3\\), find the length of \\(AC\\)."
